      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 1,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## MediaForge Timeline — cut and reassemble a source video (no model)\n\n1. Choose a video from `input/` in ⏱️ Edit Timeline (mode `cut`), then drag the ranges you want to keep in the timeline editor.\n2. Queue. Each range is loaded by 📽️ Load Segment Frames (frames + audio), appended in order and encoded once by 🧵 Assemble Segments.\n\nUse `resize` in Load Segment Frames to change the output size. Works the same way inside or outside a loop.\n\n---\n1. 在 Edit Timeline（mode `cut`）選 `input/` 裡的影片，在時間軸上拖出要保留的區段。\n2. 執行。每段由 Load Segment Frames 讀出畫面與音訊、依序 Append，最後由 Assemble Segments 一次編碼。\n\n要改輸出尺寸請用 Load Segment Frames 的 `resize`。"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## MediaForge Timeline — cut and reassemble a source video (no model)\n\n1. Choose a video from `input/` in ⏱️ Edit Timeline (mode `cut`), then drag the ranges you want to keep in the timeline editor.\n2. Queue. Each range is loaded by 📽️ Load Segment Frames (frames + audio), appended in order and encoded once by 🧵 Assemble Segments.\n\nUse `resize` in Load Segment Frames to change the output size. Works the same way inside or outside a loop.\n\n---\n1. 在 Edit Timeline（mode `cut`）選 `input/` 裡的影片，在時間軸上拖出要保留的區段。\n2. 執行。每段由 Load Segment Frames 讀出畫面與音訊、依序 Append，最後由 Assemble Segments 一次編碼。\n\n要改輸出尺寸請用 Load Segment Frames 的 `resize`。"
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
